      "title": "The two guards, and why they exist",
      "items": [
        "An empty body once saved as sendable: \"Dear X,\" and a signature",
        "A refusal once shipped as an approved follow-up",
        "Openings need 120 characters, follow-ups 60 — measured",
        "Two attempts first, so a one-second blip does not fall back"
      ]
    },
